]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/11/business/economy/fed-jobs-rates.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 10:25:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kalshi and Polymarket Create New Competition for Professional Economists</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/11/business/economy/forecasts-prediction-markets-economy.html</link><description>&lt;![CDATA[
